LD LIKE TO INQUIRE ABOUT POTENTIALLY PURSUING CLAIMS TO RECOVER YOUR LOSS UNDER THE FEDERAL SECURITIES LAWS, YO."}{'symbol': 'VTRS', 'date': '2023-05-19 09:00:00', 'title': 'INVESTOR ALERT: LAW OFFICES OF HOWARD G. SMITH ANNOUNCES INVESTIGATION OF VIATRIS INC. (VTRS) ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS', 'text': "BENSALEM, PA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--LAW OFFICES OF HOWARD G. SMITH ANNOUNCES AN INVESTIGATION ON BEHALF OF VIATRIS INC. (“VIATRIS” OR THE “COMPANY”) (NASDAQ: VTRS) INVESTORS CONCERNING THE COMPANY'S POSSIBLE VIOLATIONS OF FEDERAL SECURITIES LAWS. ON FEBRUARY 28, 2022, BEFORE THE MARKET OPENED, VIATRIS REVEALED THAT IT HAD DECIDED TO UNDERTAKE A GLOBAL RESHAPING OF ITS BUSINESS, ANNOUNCING THAT IT HAD ENTERED INTO AN AGREEMENT TO SELL IT BIOSIMILARS BUSINESS TO BIOCON BIOLOGICS LIMITED AND WAS SEEKI."}